{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And the children of Israel shall keep.</b> They shall watch and anticipate all the days of the week — which day among them will be the day of Shabbat — to prepare all their needs on the sixth day, so as to make it according to its law and not profane it. <b>And the children of Israel shall keep.</b> The verse repeats it on account of 'an everlasting covenant.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:01:22.509115613Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}